      "title": "MODEL-FREE MASK PREVIEW",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Upload the included concentric mask clip. Choose frame_index (0 is the first frame), adjust the profile, then Run. No models or sampler are needed. Use ComfyUI auto queue on change for previews after edits.\n\nRed is selected by default; change RGB to 0 / 255 / 0 for green. The preview compares the original mask, altered A, and complementary B. The generator's average_inside default differs from this interior_gradient demonstration; select either mode to compare.\n\nWidths are measured at the loader's 512 x 512 mask resolution. Copy your chosen values to the corresponding generation profile. The preview shows spatial weights before H3 temporal grouping and conditioning-strength normalization."
      ],
